}
```

4.6 RECURSION ON GRAPHS
-----------------------
DFS Traversal:
```
void dfs(int vertex, boolean[] visited, List<List<Integer>> graph) {
    visited[vertex] = true;
    System.out.print(vertex + " ");
    
    for (int neighbor : graph.get(vertex)) {
        if (!visited[neighbor]) {
            dfs(neighbor, visited, graph);
        }
    }
}
```

